      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CRISIS AVERTED (7) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing sixth (19.66) in a Restricted WIN at Q Straight. Looks the one to beat on his best form. STOWAWAY (3) was responsible for a modest effort most recently when fifth at Q Parklands over 710m behind Kitty Ann (42.35) in a Grade 5/6. Likely to be thereabouts. JET SPRINGER (8) should enjoy clear running from the outside box. Below best latest at this track (20.47) when 8th and beaten 5.5 lengths. Goes very well at course and distance boasting five wins. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings five times from seven attempts. Has ability and can atone. SOLO RUPEE (1) was in the money last start after showing plenty of early dash - should feature again.",
